<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Hoogovens.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Hoogovens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued seven million American-style call warrants, on Hoogovens bearer shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by five warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100 SFR		   PREMIUM	25.58 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.60 SFR		  GEARING	10.75 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 12.AUG.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	11.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  86 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
